{"seq":6,"slug":"controversies-and-appraisal","title":"柏拉图·controversies-and-appraisal","stage":"DONE","category":"plato","categoryLabel":"柏拉图","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/controversies-and-appraisal","rating":{"composite":3.78,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/21_plato/6_controversies-and-appraisal","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"柏拉图-争议与评价\">柏拉图·争议与评价</h1><p>本 hub 是柏拉图系列的<strong>收束与反思篇</strong>：当前面五个兄弟 hub 已正面建构了柏拉图的生平、核心贡献、思想方法、著作与影响之后，本 hub 专门处理&quot;批判性的另一面&quot;——理念论面临的逻辑困难、《理想国》引发的政治争论、苏格拉底问题的史料困境，并在此基础上给出辩证的总评。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-vs-兄弟-hub-的分工\">本 hub vs 兄弟 hub 的分工</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>hub</th>\n<th>视角</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的边界</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a></td>\n<td>正面建构理念论、《理想国》</td>\n<td>本 hub 不重述学说内容，只讨论其<strong>困难与争议</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a></td>\n<td>知识论、灵魂、辩证法</td>\n<td>本 hub 借辩证法精神评判，不展开方法本身</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../major-works/\">著作</a></td>\n<td>对话的分期与内容</td>\n<td>本 hub 用分期解决苏格拉底问题，不做文本导读</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a></td>\n<td>正面的历史影响</td>\n<td>本 hub 给出含争议的<strong>辩证总评</strong>，而非影响清单</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话：兄弟 hub 回答&quot;柏拉图主张什么、贡献什么&quot;，本 hub 回答&quot;这些主张有什么问题、该如何全面评价&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><p>前置：建议先读 <a href=\"../core-contributions/the-theory-of-forms/\">理念论</a> 与 <a href=\"../core-contributions/the-republic/\">《理想国》</a>，否则本 hub 的困难讨论会失去参照。</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>理念论的困难</strong> → <a href=\"problems-of-forms/the-third-man-argument\">第三人论证</a>：逻辑层面最尖锐的反驳（OM/SP/NI 三前提）。</li>\n<li><strong>柏拉图的应对</strong> → <a href=\"problems-of-forms/platos-self-critique\">柏拉图的自我批判</a>：困难恰由柏拉图本人提出，并在晚期重铸学说。</li>\n<li><strong>政治争论</strong> → <a href=\"debates/the-republic-and-totalitarianism\">《理想国》与极权主义之争</a>：波普尔 vs 莱文森。</li>\n<li><strong>史料争论</strong> → <a href=\"debates/the-socratic-problem-revisited\">苏格拉底问题再议</a>：如何切分苏格拉底与柏拉图。</li>\n<li><strong>崇高地位</strong> → <a href=\"overall-appraisal/the-fountainhead-of-western-thought\">西方思想的源头</a>：怀特海&quot;脚注说&quot;的具体支撑。</li>\n<li><strong>辩证总评</strong> → <a href=\"overall-appraisal/a-balanced-assessment\">全面的评判</a>：把前五篇汇为一张&quot;资产负债表&quot;。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>建议按 1→6 顺序阅读：前四篇是具体争议，后两篇是综合评价，最后一篇的&quot;资产负债表&quot;会逐条回指前面各篇。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"problems-of-forms","title":"Problems Of Forms","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/controversies-and-appraisal/problems-of-forms","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-third-man-argument","title":"第三人论证","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/controversies-and-appraisal/problems-of-forms/the-third-man-argument"},{"seq":2,"slug":"platos-self-critique","title":"柏拉图的自我批判","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/controversies-and-appraisal/problems-of-forms/platos-self-critique"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"debates","title":"Debates","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/controversies-and-appraisal/debates","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-republic-and-totalitarianism","title":"《理想国》与极权主义之争","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/controversies-and-appraisal/debates/the-republic-and-totalitarianism"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-socratic-problem-revisited","title":"苏格拉底问题再议","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/controversies-and-appraisal/debates/the-socratic-problem-revisited"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"overall-appraisal","title":"Overall Appraisal","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-fountainhead-of-western-thought","title":"西方思想的源头","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal/the-fountainhead-of-western-thought"},{"seq":2,"slug":"a-balanced-assessment","title":"全面的评判","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal/a-balanced-assessment"}]}]}